rmal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(3, 45, 66); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;&quot;&gt;marking a class like &quot;Servers&quot; as a Principal Class will ensure that only server-related CIs appear when selecting a configuration item from an&amp;nbsp;ITSM record, reducing clutter and improving efficiency.&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
