        <mxCell id="nKA0zrrdCLjoVEnoJHJr-147" parent="1" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(99, 223, 78); font-family: &amp;quot;ServiceNow Sans Display Bold&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans Myanmar&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 32px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(3, 45, 66); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;&quot;&gt;Choosing the correct identification method&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(99, 223, 78); font-family: &amp;quot;ServiceNow Sans Display Bold&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans Myanmar&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 32px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(3, 45, 66); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;ServiceNow Sans&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans Myanmar&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; background-color: rgb(3, 45, 66);&quot;&gt;The identifier entry criterion attributes must be unique to that configuration item (i.e., serial number, host name, install directory, config file path).&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;ServiceNow Sans&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans Myanmar&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; background-color: rgb(3, 45, 66);&quot;&gt;The identifier entry criterion attributes must not change for the life of the configuration item (i.e., Serial number as IP address may change over time for the same CI and is not considered a solid choice).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;ServiceNow Sans&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans Myanmar&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; background-color: rgb(3, 45, 66);&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="278" width="550" x="-798" y="4227" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
