        <mxCell id="I0yAW01L6lgJ797CFzhT-45" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=#0e8088;fillColor=#b0e3e6;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="If this data refresh rule is not there then once data is fetched by ServiceNow and then it block other low priority source, and if it didn&#39;t update the data within 14 days for refresh it will become stale,&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div&gt;Data Refresh Rule make sure that CIs are up to date if Servicenow didn&#39;t give any response then the low priority source would be considered.&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
